# X Header Asset Source for `@agentsgowild`\par
\par
## Recommended source image (highest broadly available public copy)\par
- Source: https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/1/11/Disaster_Girl.jpg\par
- Context page: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disaster_Girl\par
\par
## X header sizing target\par
- Final canvas: **1500 x 500 px** (3:1)\par
- Keep key subject (face) inside center safe area to avoid cropping on mobile.\par
\par
## Fast workflow to produce upload-ready header\par
1. Download source image from the URL above.\par
2. In Canva, Figma, or Photoshop create a 1500x500 canvas.\par
3. Place the image, scale until the face sits on right-third and fire stays visible left-third.\par
4. Export as JPG (quality 85–90) under ~2 MB.\par
5. Upload in X profile header and preview on desktop + mobile.\par
